Nute: They must be dead by now. Destroy what's left of them.

[The hologram disappears. The door opens to reveal TC-14 carrying a tray.]

TC-14: Oh! Excuse me.

Battle Droid 1: Check it out, Corporal. We'll cover you.

Battle Droid 2: Roger, roger.

[Two flashing laser swords fly out of the deadly fog, cutting down several battle droids before they can fire.]

Battle Droid: Uh-oh. Blast them.

[The two Jedis start killing the Battle Droids.]

Nute: What is going on down there?

Tey How: We lost the transmission, sir.

[The Jedi kill the battle droids. One holds up the force.]

Rune: Have you ever encountered a Jedi knight before, sir?

Nute: Well, no, but I don't. Seal off the bridge.

